 "_doc": "Emunsoft 'TAX INVOICE/STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT': header (Account Number, Account Date, Street, Deposit), a METER READINGS table (meter, type, old/new reading, reading date, reading type, consumption) and an ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger (DATE CODE DESCRIPTION UNITS TARIFF VALUE, ex-VAT values, one VAT line for the whole bill), aging and a remittance TOTAL DUE. Fingerprint: Thaba Chweu's own VAT number as printed (spaced) + 'THABA CHWEU LOCAL MUNICIPALITY'. TOU account: TOU: PEAK / STANDARD / OFF-PEAK KWH lines, TOU: KVA LV (-> demand), ACCESS CHARGE and TOU: FIXED CHARGE (-> other); every electricity line has a TOU* tariff code, which also defines the non-electricity lines. Some bills split a month into two sets of TOU lines (summed). The meter is printed as three kWh registers + three kVA registers, so meter = the kWh register ids and start/end readings stay blank. IDENTITY x_elec_resid_r = TOTAL DUE - Opening Balance - every non-electricity ledger line (payments, other services, interest, rebates) - the VAT line, i.e. the electricity total implied by the bill's own balance movement, independent of the electricity lines; 0.00 gap on all 10 bills (10 checked).",
